@startuml HU15_AutoMatch_secuencia
title HU-15 — Auto-match por preferencias del prestamista\nSpecification + Factory

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Prestamista"                      as Lender
boundary    "Frontend (React)"                 as UI
control     "marketplaceController"            as MC
participant "authMiddleware (protect)"         as MW
participant "RecommendationService"            as RS
participant "ISpecification\n(Amount/Apy/Collateral/Ltv/CreditScore)" as SPEC
participant "CreditScoreService\n<<Strategy>>" as CSS
participant "MatchingService"                  as MS
participant "LoanFactory\n(Fixed/Variable)"    as LF
participant "LedgerService"                    as LED
participant "NotificationService"              as NTF
database    "PostgreSQL\n(lender_preferences,\noffers, loans)" as DB

autonumber

note over RS, SPEC
  Specification: las preferencias se traducen en specs componibles con .and().
  spec = AmountSpec.and(ApySpec).and(CollateralSpec).and(LtvSpec).and(CreditScoreSpec).
  Reutiliza LoanFactory del R01 para crear el préstamo.
end note

== Definir preferencias ==
Lender -> UI : Guardar preferencias
UI -> MC : POST /api/preferences { maxAmount, minApy,\n collateralTypes, maxLtv, minCreditScore, autoMatch } (JWT)
MC -> MW : protect
MW --> MC : req.user
MC -> DB : LenderPreference.upsert({ lenderId, ... })
DB --> MC : preference
MC --> UI : 201 { preference }

== Recomendaciones ==
UI -> MC : GET /api/marketplace/recommendations (JWT)
MC -> RS : getRecommendations(req.user.id)
activate RS
RS -> DB : LenderPreference.findOne({ lenderId })
DB --> RS : preference
RS -> RS : buildSpecification(preference)  (compone con .and())
RS -> DB : Offer.findAll({ type:'borrow', status:'active' })
DB --> RS : solicitudes
loop por cada solicitud
    RS -> SPEC : isSatisfiedBy(offer)
    SPEC -> CSS : (CreditScoreSpec) getScore(borrowerId)
    CSS --> SPEC : { score, category }
    SPEC --> RS : true / false
end
RS --> MC : recomendaciones (solo las que cumplen TODAS las specs)
deactivate RS
MC --> UI : 200 [ ... ]

== Auto-match ==
UI -> MC : POST /api/marketplace/auto-match (JWT)
MC -> MS : autoMatch(req.user.id)
activate MS
MS -> RS : getRecommendations(lenderId)
RS --> MS : recomendaciones ordenadas
alt no hay recomendación compatible
    MS --> MC : null
    MC --> UI : 404 { message: 'sin matches' }
else hay mejor candidata
    MS -> LF : createFromOffer(bestOffer, lenderId, borrowerId)
    LF -> DB : Loan.create({ ... })
    DB --> LF : loan
    MS -> DB : Offer.update({ status:'matched' })
    MS -> LED : record(borrowerId, 'DISBURSEMENT', amount, 'loan', loan.id)
    LED -> DB : LedgerEntry.create(...)
    MS -> NTF : notify(lenderId & borrowerId, 'MATCH', ...)
    NTF -> DB : Notification.create(...) x2
    MS --> MC : { loan }
    deactivate MS
    MC --> UI : 201 { loan }
    UI --> Lender : Préstamo creado con la mejor solicitud compatible
end

note over Lender, DB
  Specification permite añadir nuevos criterios sin tocar los existentes (OCP).
  QA: recommendationService.test.js (cumple todas, excluye por score,
  auto-match crea préstamo, complejidad ciclomática >4).
end note

@enduml
